<item>
            <title>[LU-20879] MDT recovery hang</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20879</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Clients send batched statahead RPCs (&lt;tt&gt;MDS_BATCH&lt;/tt&gt;) to &lt;tt&gt;OUT_PORTAL&lt;/tt&gt;, so they&apos;re handled by the MDT&apos;s OUT threads (&lt;tt&gt;mdt_out&lt;/tt&gt;, and &lt;tt&gt;ost_out&lt;/tt&gt; on combined MDS/OSS nodes). A batched getattr can wait on another MDT. If that MDT is restarting, the OUT threads fill up waiting for it, and the restarting MDT&apos;s recovery reads, which also need those threads, never get served. Recovery hangs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
